 "title": "Telomere Maintenance and Repair in Saccharomyces Genome Database",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around telomere maintenance and repair in Saccharomyces cerevisiae. Telomerase, a gene involved in telomere maintenance, is associated with telomeric amplicons, a process that Brewer Bonita J. conceptualized. Telomere adjacent sequence, which contains telomere, is amplified by SUL1 and yku70. Telomere is also involved in mmBIR, a process that requires POL32 and yku70. DNA repair, which involves telomerase, is crucial for telomere maintenance. Various genes, including POL32, Rad52, and yku70, are amplified or mutated, affecting telomere maintenance and repair.",
